18:T6c4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Are Chevening and Commonwealth applications currently open for Pakistan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"At the 25 October 2026 check, Chevening Pakistan and Commonwealth Master’s 2027–2028 applications are closed. Follow the current official page for amendments or a future call; later selection tasks do not reopen the scholarship form."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which scholarship route should an undergraduate applicant use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Start with awards that explicitly fund first degrees and check entry-year and nomination conditions. Master’s and PhD scholarship rules cannot be applied to an undergraduate application."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a master’s scholarship pay for an MBA?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only when that award and institution permit the exact MBA and cover the relevant fees. Check eligible-course rules and exclusions instead of treating all master’s degrees as interchangeable."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I get a scholarship abroad without IELTS from Pakistan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sometimes, if the scholarship and chosen institution accept another test, Medium of Instruction evidence or a waiver. Admission, scholarship and visa rules must be checked separately in writing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does HEC nominate applicants for every scholarship?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Some routes involve HEC or another national body, while others use an embassy, university, consortium or direct programme portal. Follow the exact current process for each award."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspi