licant qualifies. The linked owner controls amendments and final decisions.",{"children":"Checked 25 October 2026. These are named routes, not a claim that every Pakistani applicant qualifies. The linked owner controls amendments and final decisions."}]],"$undefined","$L1c","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"]}],false,"$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]
